# scripts/secrets_gate.allow — files the secrets gate does not read, one per
# line: <path-regex><TAB><reason>.  A real secret is fixed, never allowed.
tests/oauthtoken_tests\.nv	the tests use the example bearer token of RFC 6749 § 7.1, a published vector
tests/oauthoidc_signed_tests\.nv	the tokens are test fixtures signed by throwaway keys that tests/generate/gen_oidc.py makes and discards
